Hi,

How are you!

Good news — your quote {!Quote.Name} has been successfully submitted for approval! 🎉

Our approval team has been alerted and is now reviewing it (coffee in hand ☕, of course). You’ll receive an update as soon as it’s approved or if any tweaks are needed.

In the meantime, feel free to celebrate this small victory — every great deal starts with a click! 💪



Quote Name : {!Quote.Name}
Account Name : {!Quote.Bill_To_Account__c}
Total Price : {!Quote.Total_Price_Summary__c}


Total Deal Quantity : {!Quote.Total_Deal_Quantity__c}


Thank you for keeping the sales engines running strong.



Warm regards,
The Sales Operations Team
“Turning quotes into closed deals, one approval at a time.”
